{%- comment -%}
  Casa Chevalier — Benvenuto nuovo iscritto (IT)
  Paste into Shopify admin → Marketing → Automations →
  "Welcome to Casa Chevalier" → Edit email → add a "Custom Liquid"
  section and replace the existing content sections with this.
  Email clients block scripts, so there is no copy button: the code
  sits on its own in a box, which selects whole with a tap or
  double-click.
